## Phase 4B Scope Definition

Phase 4B is responsible for expanding the behavioral coverage of the Understanding layer within the frozen Cognitive API Specification.

The objective is not to redesign the architecture or modify semantic contracts.

Instead, Phase 4B incrementally increases the range of natural language the Understanding layer can correctly interpret while continuing to produce the existing SemanticInterpretation contract.

No schema modifications should occur during Phase 4B unless a verified conflict with the approved Cognitive API Specification is discovered.


